setclk.c is Commodore-Amiga's, from AMIX 2.1c (usr/amiga/src/cmd/setclk), as
published in github.com/amigaux/amix-system: Amiga Corporation approved
releasing Amiga UNIX on 2026-09-23 and the files are published under that
approval (see that repository's README, "Licensing").

patches/0001-four-digit-year.patch: public domain.
